Notes Planner

A smart and simple productivity platform for managing notes, tasks, schedules, and academic planning in one place.

Overview

Notes Planner is a web-based application designed to help students and professionals organize their daily workflow efficiently. The platform combines note-taking, task management, and planning tools into a single streamlined interface.

The goal of the project is to improve productivity by allowing users to:

Create and manage notes
Organize tasks and deadlines
Plan schedules effectively
Access information quickly through a clean interface

Features
Notes Management
Create, edit, and delete notes
Organize notes efficiently
Store important academic or personal information
Task Planning
Add tasks with priorities
Track pending and completed tasks
Manage deadlines and schedules
User-Friendly Interface
Clean and responsive UI
Easy navigation
Organized dashboard for productivity

Usage
Open the application in your browser.
Create notes and organize them.
Add tasks and manage schedules.
Track productivity through the planner dashboard.
